From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:44:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 28/73] Host config API replaces timing env vars; delete
 finished-investigation trace knobs

PS2HostConfig (wall clock, VBlank rate, IOP heap floor) is set by the host before
initialize instead of PS2X_WALLCLOCK[_STRICT], PS2X_EXPERIMENT_VSYNC_HZ and
PS2X_IOP_HEAP_BASE. Removed with their code paths: TARZAN_TRACE_VIDEO/MPEG/IOP_RPC/
IOP_EPOCH/MFIFO[_POLL]/VIF1/VIF_NAN/NAN_WRITES/UNINDEX_BUFFER/INDIRECT, TARZAN_IOP_DUMP,
PS2X_TRACE_WALLCLOCK, PS2X_IOP_WATCH_WORD, PS2X_IOP_IDLE_FASTPATH, PS2X_VU1_STATS,
PS2X_VU1_CACHE_STATS.

